p.s.
 the meta–spiritual questions are "why did I bother to write any of this?" and "what is the ontological status of this text?" The answer to the second question seems to be that this text is a ghost,
 of sorts,
 inviting you to taste and partake of a certain connected bundle or structural blob of interconnected feelings,
